{"id":"steam-1356660","steam":1356660,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Starlit World","summary":"Help Bo & Kikki save the Starlits from Oli’s evil spell in a cute and chaotic 3D platforming adventure! Discover special suits, fight bosses, and explore magical worlds as you rebuild Starlit Island and complete your sticker album!","about":"Explore Enchanting Worlds\n\nTravel through unique landscapes and charming places, each with its own obstacles and challenges. Find hidden paths and discover something new in every world.\r\n \r\n \n\nRescue the Starlits\n\nExplore during the day and survive the night. Run, jump, and fight enemies as you collect gems and grow stronger. Find the scattered Starlits and bring them safely back home.\r\n\r\n\nFight Mighty Bosses\n\nFace a powerful boss at the end of each world. Learn their attacks, dodge at the right time, and break Oli’s spell to set them free.\n\nDiscover Special Suits\n\nEach suit offers unique powers and a different playstyle. Choose the one that best fits your style to explore, fight enemies, and overcome challenges your way.\n\n\r\nRebuild Starlit Island\n\nBring Starlit Island back to life with every Starlit you rescue. Explore new areas, meet its residents, and watch the island grow. Collect stickers, complete your album, and unlock rewards.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/9d404141c98816ef2c642aeebc522d225088bd72/library_capsule.jpg?t=1792452735","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/294d76521e07ebca3d5249abdc7d4ffc18ff91f8/header.jpg?t=1792452735","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/e046b7493a3f06457f873120bc209a9dbce946dc/library_hero.jpg?t=1792452735","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/294d76521e07ebca3d5249abdc7d4ffc18ff91f8/header.jpg?t=1792452735","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store